<div class="article-header ">
						<a class="article-eyebrow" href="https://www.nbcsportsboston.com/tag/nba/">NBA</a>					<h1 class="article-header__headline">
		How many NBA teams have never won a championship? Wolves, Pacers seeking first title	</h1>
				<h2 class="article-header__subtitle">
			The Minnesota Timberwolves and Indiana Pacers are among the 10 current NBA teams that are yet to win a championship.		</h2>
	
			
<div class="article-header__meta" data-component="articleMeta">
	<h4 class="article-header__meta-byline">
					By Mike Gavin							<span class="article-header__meta-dot">&bull;</span>
					
									<span class="article-header__meta-time">
					<time class="entry-date published" datetime="2024-05-20T19:28:33-04:00">Published May 20, 2024</time>				</span>
						</h4>
