						<div class="post__text">
							<div class="post__meta">
																	<a data-lpos="inline-recirc-module" data-lid="Boston Celtics" class="post__tag" href="https://www.nbcsportsboston.com/tag/boston-celtics/">Boston Celtics</a>
																									<span class="post__date post__date--has-category">
										Sep 30									</span>
															</div>

															<h3 class="post__title">
									<a data-lpos="inline-recirc-module" data-lid="Mike Conley Jr. raves about Jayson Tatum&#039;s leadership for Celtics" class="post__title--link" href="https://www.nbcsportsboston.com/nba/boston-celtics/mike-conley-jr-jayson-tatum-leadership-celtics/805353/">
										Mike Conley Jr. raves about Jayson Tatum&#039;s leadership for Celtics									</a>
								</h3>
													</div>
					</div>
				</div>
					</div>
	
<p><strong>BROOKLYN NETS</strong></p>

<p><strong>Joined NBA: </strong>1976</p>

<p><strong>NBA Finals appearances: </strong>2 (2002, 2003)</p>

<p>The Nets have not won a title since joining the NBA in 1976. But they did win two ABA titles!</p>

<p><strong>CHARLOTTE HORNETS</strong></p>

<p><strong>Joined NBA: </strong>1988</p>

<p><strong>NBA Finals appearances</strong>: None</p>

<p>Neither the Hornets nor the Bobcats have won a title. In fact, they are one of two teams to have never advanced beyond the second round of the playoffs. Probably why Michael Jordan sold the team.</p>

<p><strong>INDIANA PACERS </strong></p>

<p><strong>Joined NBA: </strong>1976</p>

<p><strong>NBA Finals appearances: </strong>1 (2000)</p>

<p>The Pacers, a three-time ABA champion, pushed a <a href="https://www.nbclosangeles.com/tag/los-angeles-lakers/" data-type="link" data-id="https://www.nbclosangeles.com/tag/los-angeles-lakers/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">Los Angeles Lakers</a> team led by Shaquille O'Neal and Kobe Bryant to six games in the 2000 Finals.</p>
<div data-react-component='VideoPlaylist' data-props='{&quot;accountId&quot;:&quot;4uiGmEWh4WEa&quot;,&quot;autoplay&quot;:false,&quot;placeholder&quot;:true,&quot;brand&quot;:&quot;nbc&quot;,&quot;host&quot;:&quot;nbcsportsboston.com&quot;,&quot;twitter&quot;:&quot;NBCSBoston&quot;,&quot;callLetters&quot;:&quot;NSBO&quot;,&quot;station&quot;:&quot;rsn boston&quot;,&quot;excludeEndCard&quot;:false,&quot;islead&quot;:false,&quot;fastSchedule&quot;:[],&quot;videos&quot;:[{&quot;mediaId&quot;:&quot;ZO8byCE9Ku9e&quot;,&quot;poster&quot;:&quot;https:\/\/media.nbcsportsboston.com\/2024\/05\/ECF_set.png?resize=850%2C478&amp;quality=85&amp;strip=all&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;Celtics, Pacers to meet in 2024 Eastern Conference Finals&quot;,&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https:\/\/www.nbcsportsboston.com\/video\/nba\/boston-celtics\/celtics-pacers-2024-eastern-conference-finals\/614309\/&quot;,&quot;videoContentId&quot;:&quot;1:1:9549837&quot;,&quot;videoId&quot;:&quot;2338914883962&quot;,&quot;isLivestream&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;isFast&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;m3uPid&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;mp4Url&quot;:&quot;https:\/\/prodamdlim.akamaized.net\/NBCU_LM_VMS\/292\/55\/DIT_RSN_FANATICS_NBA_EASTERN_CONFERNCE_FINALS_SET_CELTICS_BOSTON_051924_EM_2338917443689_mp4_video_1920x1080_4872000_primary_audio_eng_6.mp4&quot;,&quot;m3u8Url&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;catNames&quot;:{&quot;8698&quot;:&quot;NHL&quot;,&quot;8304&quot;:&quot;Boston Bruins&quot;,&quot;8696&quot;:&quot;NBA&quot;,&quot;8302&quot;:&quot;Boston Celtics&quot;,&quot;8309&quot;:&quot;News&quot;},&quot;tagNames&quot;:{&quot;40314&quot;:&quot;2024 NBA Playoffs&quot;,&quot;36341&quot;:&quot;Boston Celtics&quot;,&quot;36282&quot;:&quot;Chris Forsberg&quot;,&quot;38636&quot;:&quot;Featured Basketball&quot;,&quot;38546&quot;:&quot;Indiana Pacers&quot;},&quot;contentSource&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;sentiment&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;topic&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;origination&quot;:&quot;NBCU LM VMS&quot;,&quot;sponsorName&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;datePublished&quot;:&quot;2024-05-19T18:24:53&quot;,&quot;duration&quot;:63,&quot;syndicated_id&quot;:&quot;1:1:9549837&quot;,&quot;videoSport&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;videoLeague&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;videoTeam&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;show&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;event&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;genre&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;originCallLetters&quot;:&quot;NATIONALNBC&quot;,&quot;canonicalUrl&quot;:&quot;https:\/\/www.nbcsandiego.com\/video\/news\/sports\/celtics-pacers-2024-eastern-conference-finals\/3518501\/&quot;,&quot;sensitivity&quot;:[],&quot;no_external&quot;:false,&quot;disableEmbed&quot;:false}]}'></div><div class="video_caption" data-react-component="ShowMoreText" data-expanded="false">
								The Pacers shot a record-breaking 67.1% to beat the New York Knicks 130-109 in Game 7 to advance to the Eastern Conference Finals. Indiana will face the Boston Celtics.
							</div>
<p><strong>LOS ANGELES CLIPPERS </strong></p>

<p><strong>Joined NBA: </strong>1970</p>

<p><strong>NBA Finals appearances: </strong>None</p>

<p>The Clippers' postseason history is well documented, as is the organization's past dysfunction. <a href="/news/sports/nba/donald-sterling-clippers-series-trailer" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">There's even a television series about it</a>.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>

<p><strong>MEMPHIS GRIZZLIES </strong></p>

<p><strong>Joined NBA: </strong>1995</p>

<p><strong>NBA Finals appearances: </strong>None</p>

<p>The Grizzlies have more international relocations than NBA championships, having shifted from Vancouver to Memphis in 2001.</p>

<p><strong>MINNESOTA TIMBERWOLVES </strong></p>

<p><strong>Joined NBA: </strong>1989</p>

<p><strong>NBA Finals appearances: </strong>None</p>

<p>The Timberwolves currently have the best odds of being the next team to permanently remove itself from this list, with blossoming young star Anthony Edwards having led the team to the Western Conference Finals at 22 years old.</p>
<div data-react-component='VideoPlaylist' data-props='{&quot;accountId&quot;:&quot;4uiGmEWh4WEa&quot;,&quot;autoplay&quot;:false,&quot;placeholder&quot;:true,&quot;brand&quot;:&quot;nbc&quot;,&quot;host&quot;:&quot;nbcsportsboston.com&quot;,&quot;twitter&quot;:&quot;NBCSBoston&quot;,&quot;callLetters&quot;:&quot;NSBO&quot;,&quot;station&quot;:&quot;rsn boston&quot;,&quot;excludeEndCard&quot;:false,&quot;islead&quot;:false,&quot;fastSchedule&quot;:[],&quot;videos&quot;:[{&quot;mediaId&quot;:&quot;7h1WHLbI38Ft&quot;,&quot;poster&quot;:&quot;https:\/\/media.nbcsportsboston.com\/2024\/05\/WCF_a789b6.png?resize=850%2C478&amp;quality=85&amp;strip=all&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;Timberwolves, Mavericks to meet in 2024 Western Conference Finals&quot;,&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https:\/\/www.nbcsportsboston.com\/video\/news\/timberwolves-mavericks-2024-western-conference-finals\/614360\/&quot;,&quot;videoContentId&quot;:&quot;1:1:9550125&quot;,&quot;videoId&quot;:&quot;2338949187808&quot;,&quot;isLivestream&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;isFast&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;m3uPid&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;mp4Url&quot;:&quot;https:\/\/prodamdlim.akamaized.net\/NBCU_LM_VMS\/324\/787\/DIT_RSN_FANATICS_NBA_WESTERN_CONFERNCE_FINALS_SET_TIMBERWOLVES_MAVERICKS_051924_EM_2338951747687_mp4_video_1920x1080_4872000_primary_audio_eng_6.mp4&quot;,&quot;m3u8Url&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;catNames&quot;:{&quot;8309&quot;:&quot;News&quot;},&quot;tagNames&quot;:{&quot;38636&quot;:&quot;Featured Basketball&quot;},&quot;contentSource&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;sentiment&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;topic&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;origination&quot;:&quot;NBCU LM VMS&quot;,&quot;sponsorName&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;datePublished&quot;:&quot;2024-05-19T22:56:06&quot;,&quot;duration&quot;:47,&quot;syndicated_id&quot;:&quot;1:1:9550125&quot;,&quot;videoSport&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;videoLeague&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;videoTeam&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;show&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;event&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;genre&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;originCallLetters&quot;:&quot;NATIONALNBC&quot;,&quot;canonicalUrl&quot;:&quot;https:\/\/www.necn.com\/video\/news\/sports\/timberwolves-mavericks-2024-western-conference-finals\/3238545\/&quot;,&quot;sensitivity&quot;:[],&quot;no_external&quot;:false,&quot;disableEmbed&quot;:false}]}'></div><div class="video_caption" data-react-component="ShowMoreText" data-expanded="false">
								The Timberwolves stunned the Denver Nuggets to advance to the Western Conference Finals for the second time in franchise history. Minnesota will face the Dallas Mavericks.
							</div>
<p><strong>NEW ORLEANS PELICANS</strong></p>

<p><strong>Joined NBA: </strong>2002</p>

<p><strong>NBA Finals appearances: </strong>None</p>

<p>The Pelicans, like the Hornets, are the only teams in the league that have never reached the conference finals. Perhaps one day we'll get the Pelicans-Hornets NBA Finals matchup we deserve.</p>

<p><strong>ORLANDO MAGIC </strong></p>

<p><strong>Joined NBA: </strong>1989</p>

<p><strong>NBA Finals appearances: </strong>2 (1995, 2009)</p>

<p>The Orlando Magic have made it to the Finals twice and lost both. But they will forever be the last team to eliminate Michael Jordan's <a href="https://www.nbcsportschicago.com/tag/chicago-bulls/" data-type="link" data-id="https://www.nbcsportschicago.com/tag/chicago-bulls/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">Chicago Bulls</a>, so there's that.</p>

<p><strong>PHOENIX SUNS</strong></p>

<p><strong>Joined NBA: </strong>1968</p>

<p><strong>NBA Finals appearances: </strong>3 (1976, 1993, 2021)</p>

<p>The Suns have been two wins away from winning a title on three occasions, including in 2021 when they held a 2-0 series lead over the Bucks. They are the only current team in the league to have reached three NBA Finals without winning a championship.&nbsp;</p>

<p><strong>UTAH JAZZ</strong></p>

<p><strong>Joined NBA: </strong>1974</p>

<p><strong>NBA Finals appearances: </strong>2 (1997, 1998)</p>

<p>Thanks, Michael Jordan.</p>
<div data-react-component='VideoPlaylist' data-props='{&quot;accountId&quot;:&quot;4uiGmEWh4WEa&quot;,&quot;autoplay&quot;:false,&quot;placeholder&quot;:true,&quot;brand&quot;:&quot;nbc&quot;,&quot;host&quot;:&quot;nbcsportsboston.com&quot;,&quot;twitter&quot;:&quot;NBCSBoston&quot;,&quot;callLetters&quot;:&quot;NSBO&quot;,&quot;station&quot;:&quot;rsn boston&quot;,&quot;excludeEndCard&quot;:false,&quot;islead&quot;:false,&quot;fastSchedule&quot;:[],&quot;videos&quot;:[{&quot;mediaId&quot;:&quot;QpuxrLDZcMdI&quot;,&quot;poster&quot;:&quot;https:\/\/media.nbcsportsboston.com\/2024\/05\/DIT_RSN_NBA_FANATICS_FREE_AGENCY_2024_KEY_PLAYERS_050624_EM.00_01_38_07.Still001.jpg?quality=85&amp;strip=all&amp;resize=850%2C478&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;Everything you need to know about 2024 NBA free agency, key players available&quot;,&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https:\/\/www.nbcsportsboston.com\/video\/news\/everything-to-know-2024-nba-free-agency-key-players-available\/610553\/&quot;,&quot;videoContentId&quot;:&quot;1:1:9515830&quot;,&quot;videoId&quot;:&quot;2335018563548&quot;,&quot;isLivestream&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;isFast&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;m3uPid&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;mp4Url&quot;:&quot;https:\/\/prodamdlim.akamaized.net\/NBCU_LM_VMS\/672\/238\/DIT_RSN_NBA_FANATICS_FREE_AGENCY_2024_KEY_PLAYERS_050624_EM_2335010371923_mp4_video_1920x1080_4872000_primary_audio_eng_6.mp4&quot;,&quot;m3u8Url&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;catNames&quot;:{&quot;8309&quot;:&quot;News&quot;},&quot;tagNames&quot;:{&quot;38636&quot;:&quot;Featured Basketball&quot;},&quot;contentSource&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;sentiment&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;topic&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;origination&quot;:&quot;NBCU LM VMS&quot;,&quot;sponsorName&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;datePublished&quot;:&quot;2024-05-06T15:15:14&quot;,&quot;duration&quot;:51,&quot;syndicated_id&quot;:&quot;1:1:9515830&quot;,&quot;videoSport&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;videoLeague&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;videoTeam&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;show&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;event&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;genre&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;originCallLetters&quot;:&quot;NATIONALNBC&quot;,&quot;canonicalUrl&quot;:&quot;https:\/\/www.nbcwashington.com\/video\/news\/sports\/everything-to-know-2024-nba-free-agency-key-players-available\/3609980\/&quot;,&quot;sensitivity&quot;:[],&quot;no_external&quot;:false,&quot;disableEmbed&quot;:false}]}'></div><div class="video_caption" data-react-component="ShowMoreText" data-expanded="false">
								Here&#039;s everything you need to know about 2024 NBA free agency.
							</div>
<h2 class="wp-block-nbc-section-heading"><strong>Which teams have never appeared in the NBA Finals?</strong></h2>

<p>Five current NBA franchises have still <a href="/news/sports/which-teams-have-never-reached-the-nba-finals/" data-type="link" data-id="https://www.nbcboston.com/news/sports/which-teams-have-never-reached-the-nba-finals/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">yet to play in the Finals</a> with one team in the midst of a&nbsp;half-century drought.</p>

<ul class="wp-block-list">
<li>Los Angeles Clippers – 54 seasons</li>



<li>Minnesota Timberwolves – 35 seasons</li>



<li>Charlotte Hornets – 34 seasons</li>



<li>Memphis Grizzlies – 29 seasons</li>



<li>New Orleans Pelicans – 22 seasons</li>
</ul>
					</div>

